    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;be two real valued function defined as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are real constants. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;is differentiable at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
