  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Here&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>f</mi><msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>For continuity at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">gof</mo><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now differentiating, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;(from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>)</p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">gof</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">gof</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">gof</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
